Base directory for this skill: /Users/kinnu/Library/Application Support/Claude/local-agent-mode-sessions/skills-plugin/f060923a-0ffb-49c7-b435-a10a774eb3ee/84d47df4-ea96-4af7-87b2-551938158370/skills/indie-app-design-system

# Indie App Design System

The look: a small product made by one obsessive maker. Product-first, quietly premium, hand-tuned. The page looks like the app it sells — real UI inside real-looking window chrome, sitting on a soft gradient "desk". Typography does the heavy lifting; color is rationed; every surface has a hairline edge and a soft, long shadow; buttons are pills that feel pressable.

Distilled from six reference sites (measured from their live CSS, Oct 2026):

| Reference | What to take from it |
|---|---|
| tempo.xyz | Monochrome restraint: gray canvas + white 32px cards, ink pill CTAs, tiny uppercase eyebrows, floating pill nav, one huge rounded photo |
| chainyourmac.com | Apple-grade type and tokens, alternating mist bands, tactile amber CTA, 0.5px hairline rings, faux-macOS demos, keycaps, "try it on this page" |
| notchbuddy.com | Warm cream palette, Plus Jakarta Sans, terracotta details, product UI on warm gradient wallpapers, icon-tile grid, honest launch-price pricing |
| clacky.app | Personality: candy gradient buttons, marker highlight under an accent word, springy press motion, segmented controls, in-page playground |
| smoothrecorder.com | Saturated cobalt hero with faint grid lines, white halo CTA, muted second headline line, Outfit display face |
| molyn.app/mobile | Soft sky wash, Instrument Serif italic headline, bento grid with one accent-filled card, chat-bubble UI fragments |

Borrow the system, never the content: no copy, logos, mascots, illustrations or headlines from the references (or the examples in this file).

## Workflow

1. **Pick a mood and an accent** with the rules below. State the choice in one line and move on.
2. **Collect real content**: product name, one-line value, price and distribution (direct sale, App Store, free, not launched), platform requirements, and any real proof. Never invent social proof, ratings, user counts, press logos or testimonials. If none were supplied, drop those sections or use visibly marked placeholders like `[real quote from a user]`.
3. **Start from the foundation CSS below, verbatim.** Set `data-mood` (omit it for the default `mist`) and `data-accent` on `<html>`. Load the mood's fonts.
4. **Build sections in the canonical order** (Page anatomy). Skip what doesn't apply.
5. **Build product visuals in HTML/CSS** — real-looking UI with plausible data inside `.window`, `.desktop` or `.phone` frames on a `.stage`. If the user supplies screenshots, put them in those frames. Gray placeholder boxes are a failure.
6. **Check at 1440px and 375px, then run the pre-ship checklist.**

## Choosing the mood

**Default: `mist`, in light mode** — white page with soft `#F5F5F7` bands, white cards with hairline rings, amber candy CTA (or ink with `mono`). This is the user's preferred look; use it unless they ask for another mood or the product clearly fits one below.

| Product | Mood | Accent | Primary CTA |
|---|---|---|---|
| Anything, by default | `mist` | `amber` if it has warmth or personality, `mono` if it's serious | amber candy or ink pill |
| Pure white with hairline dividers instead of gray bands (only when asked) | `white` | `mono`, `amber` or `cobalt` | ink pill, or candy with amber/cobalt |
| Finance, infrastructure, B2B platform | `mist`, or `mist` + carded variant | `mono` | ink pill |
| Personal life, wellbeing, journaling, family, food, iPhone lifestyle | `cream` | `terracotta` | ink pill (terracotta stays in the details) |
| Creator, video/audio, AI assistant, marketing tool | `cobalt` | `cobalt` | white halo pill on the colored hero |

Variants:
- **Carded** (Tempo): mist with `--bg:#F5F5F5`, white `--r-2xl` cards, no bands, accent `mono`.
- **Wash** (Molyn): cobalt with `.hero--wash` instead of `.hero--color`, an Instrument Serif italic h1 (`<h1 class="t-serif">`), ink CTA.
- **Playful modifier** (Clacky): on white, mist or cream, add candy CTA, one marker highlight, spring press motion and an in-page toy. Playfulness is a modifier, not a mood.

## Accents — exactly one per page

| `data-accent` | Base | Text on it |
|---|---|---|
| `amber` | `#F7A028` | dark `#2A1700` |
| `terracotta` | `#D66B38` | none — never put text on terracotta fills; use it for markers only |
| `cobalt` | `#2F5BFF` | white |
| `mono` | ink | the product visual brings the color |

The accent fills only these roles: (1) the primary action, unless the mood says ink CTA; (2) one family of small markers — icon tiles, check ticks, status dots; (3) active and selected states — switches, sliders, the chosen card, focus rings. It never colors section backgrounds, body text, or more than one headline phrase. The lime marker `#D4F53C` is a separate highlighter for one phrase per page, always behind text.

## Fonts

```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<!-- white, mist --> <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400..800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<!-- cream -->  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400..800&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<!-- cobalt --> <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400..600&family=Public+Sans:wght@400..700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<!-- optional serif accent --> <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

At most two families plus a mono. The serif is only for a display headline or one italic word, never body. The stacks fall back to system UI fonts; the page must still hold up if web fonts fail.

## Foundation CSS (paste verbatim, then build)

```css
/* ---------- Tokens ---------- */
:root{
  --bg:#FFFFFF; --bg-alt:#F5F5F7; --sunk:var(--bg-alt); --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface-2:#FAFAFB; --band-edge:none;
  --ink:#1D1D1F; --ink-2:#515154; --ink-3:#6E6E73; --ink-4:#86868B;
  --line:rgba(0,0,0,.08); --line-2:rgba(0,0,0,.14); --tint:rgba(0,0,0,.045);
  --shadow-rgb:0 0 0;
  --accent:#F7A028; --accent-hi:#FFC45A; --accent-ink:#8F5200; --accent-wash:#FFF3DE; --on-accent:#2A1700;
  --focus:var(--accent-ink); --marker:#D4F53C; --success:#1F7A3D;
  --font-display:"Inter",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  --font-body:var(--font-display);
  --font-serif:"Instrument Serif",ui-serif,Georgia,serif;
  --font-mono:"JetBrains Mono","Geist Mono",ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,monospace;
  --display-weight:700; --display-track:-.042em;
  --fs-display:clamp(42px,6.4vw,80px); --fs-h2:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px); --fs-h3:clamp(24px,3vw,38px);
  --fs-lead:clamp(17.5px,1.55vw,21px); --fs-body:16.5px; --fs-small:14.5px; --fs-micro:13px;
  --container:1120px; --text-max:680px; --gutter:24px; --section-y:clamp(80px,10vw,128px); --bleed:clamp(64px,9vw,140px);
  --r-xs:7px; --r-sm:10px; --r-md:14px; --r-lg:20px; --r-xl:28px; --r-2xl:32px; --r-pill:999px;
  --ring:0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  --shadow-1:0 0 0 .5px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.10),0 1px 2px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.06),0 6px 18px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.06);
  --shadow-2:0 0 0 .5px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.10),0 2px 6px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.05),0 24px 60px -12px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.18);
  --shadow-3:0 0 0 1px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.06),0 40px 90px -30px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.42);
  --ease-out:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); --ease-spring:cubic-bezier(.34,1.36,.64,1);
  --dur-press:.12s; --dur-hover:.2s; --dur-ui:.3s; --dur-reveal:.7s;
  --wallpaper:radial-gradient(90% 80% at 12% 100%,#FFC978 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(70% 70% at 88% 8%,#BFD9FF 0,transparent 62%),linear-gradient(160deg,#F7F3EE,#ECEFF6);
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(70% 60% at 85% 0%,#DCE8FF 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(60% 60% at 10% 100%,#FFE6C2 0,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#F7F7F9,#EEF0F4);
  --wash:linear-gradient(#DCE8FE,#EEF4FF 55%,var(--bg));
  --chrome:linear-gradient(#FBFBFB,#F1F1F2); --chrome-line:rgba(0,0,0,.08); --chrome-ink:#6E6E73;
  --key-bg:linear-gradient(#fff,#F2F2F4); --key-ink:#3A3A3C; --key-edge:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.10),0 1.5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}
[data-mood="white"]{
  --bg-alt:#FFFFFF; --sunk:#F6F6F7; --surface-2:#FAFAFA; --band-edge:inset 0 1px 0 var(--line);
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(60% 70% at 88% 0%,#EEF3FF 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(60% 60% at 8% 100%,#FFF3E2 0,transparent 60%),#FAFAFA;
}
[data-mood="cream"]{
  --bg:#FAF6EF; --bg-alt:#F3ECE1; --surface:#FFFEFC; --surface-2:#FBF8F3;
  --ink:#17150F; --ink-2:#423C33; --ink-3:#6D6459; --ink-4:#857B6E;
  --line:#EBE3D7; --line-2:#DDD2C2; --tint:rgba(23,21,15,.055); --shadow-rgb:23 16 14;
  --font-display:"Plus Jakarta Sans",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --display-track:-.035em;
  --wallpaper:radial-gradient(130% 100% at 50% -20%,#F7E6D6 0%,#E3AB7C 40%,#C2542A 100%);
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(130% 100% at 50% -20%,#FDF8F2 0%,#F2E2CE 48%,#E2C3A1 100%);
}
[data-mood="cobalt"]{
  --bg:#FDFDFE; --bg-alt:#F4F6FC; --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface-2:#FBFBFD;
  --ink:#0E1116; --ink-2:#3F4552; --ink-3:#5C6372; --ink-4:#868C9C;
  --line:#E4E6EE; --line-2:#D3D8E6; --tint:rgba(47,91,255,.07); --shadow-rgb:16 20 60;
  --font-display:"Outfit",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --font-body:"Public Sans",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --display-weight:500; --display-track:-.028em;
  --wallpaper:radial-gradient(80% 70% at 50% 0%,#8EA2FF 0%,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#3D5BF0,#1E2FA8);
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(80% 70% at 50% 0%,#E3E9FF 0%,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#F2F5FF,#E4EAFF);
}
[data-accent="terracotta"]{--accent:#D66B38;--accent-hi:#E8895A;--accent-ink:#A1411F;--on-accent:#fff}
[data-accent="cobalt"]{--accent:#2F5BFF;--accent-hi:#5B8CFF;--accent-ink:#1B3BCC;--on-accent:#fff}
[data-accent="mono"]{--accent:var(--ink);--accent-hi:color-mix(in oklab,var(--ink) 80%,var(--bg));--accent-ink:var(--ink);--on-accent:var(--bg)}
[data-accent]{--accent-wash:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 14%,var(--surface))}
/* Dark: only when the user asks for it. To follow the OS instead, repeat these blocks inside
   @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark) with :root:not([data-theme="light"]) in place of [data-theme="dark"]. */
[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0B0B0D;--bg-alt:#111114;--sunk:var(--bg-alt);--band-edge:none;--surface:#18181C;--surface-2:#1E1E23;--ink:#F2F0EB;--ink-2:#C9C7C2;--ink-3:#A4A4AE;--ink-4:#7C7C86;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);--line-2:rgba(255,255,255,.14);--tint:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--shadow-rgb:0 0 0;
  --accent-ink:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 72%,#fff); --accent-wash:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 18%,var(--surface));
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(70% 60% at 85% 0%,rgba(90,130,255,.20) 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(60% 60% at 10% 100%,rgba(255,170,80,.16) 0,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#16161A,#0F0F12);
  --wallpaper:radial-gradient(90% 80% at 12% 100%,rgba(255,170,70,.5) 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(70% 70% at 88% 8%,rgba(110,150,255,.45) 0,transparent 62%),linear-gradient(160deg,#1C1915,#13151B);
  --wash:linear-gradient(#141A33,var(--bg)); --chrome:linear-gradient(#2C2C31,#232328); --chrome-line:rgba(255,255,255,.06); --chrome-ink:#9A9AA2;
  --key-bg:linear-gradient(#2C2C32,#222227); --key-ink:#C9C7C2; --key-edge:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08),0 1.5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.6); color-scheme:dark}
[data-theme="dark"][data-mood="cream"]{--bg:#14110D;--bg-alt:#1A1611;--surface:#201B15;--surface-2:#262019;--ink:#F3ECE1;--ink-2:#D9CFC0;--ink-3:#AEA290;--ink-4:#8A7F70;--line:rgba(255,236,210,.09);--line-2:rgba(255,236,210,.15);--tint:rgba(255,236,210,.06);
  --wallpaper:radial-gradient(130% 100% at 50% -20%,#E9B48A 0%,#C9693A 45%,#7A2E12 100%);
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(130% 100% at 50% -20%,#3A2A1E 0%,#24190F 60%,#1A120B 100%)}
[data-theme="dark"][data-mood="cobalt"]{--bg:#0A0C14;--bg-alt:#0F1220;--surface:#151A2B;--surface-2:#1A2033;--ink:#EEF1FA;--ink-2:#C3C9D8;--ink-3:#99A1B5;--ink-4:#7A8296;--line:rgba(180,195,255,.10);--line-2:rgba(180,195,255,.16);--tint:rgba(120,145,255,.10);
  --wallpaper:radial-gradient(80% 70% at 50% 0%,#8EA2FF 0%,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#3D5BF0,#1E2FA8);
  --wallpaper-soft:radial-gradient(80% 70% at 50% 0%,rgba(90,120,255,.28) 0%,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#11162A,#0B0E1A)}
@media (max-width:640px){:root{--gutter:18px}}

/* ---------- Base ---------- */
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:88px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 var(--fs-body)/1.6 var(--font-body);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;overflow-x:hidden}
img,svg,video{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
p{margin:0}
::selection{background:var(--marker);color:#17150F}
:where(a,button,input,select,textarea,summary,[tabindex]):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:3px}
.container{width:min(100% - 2*var(--gutter),var(--container));margin-inline:auto}

/* ---------- Type ---------- */
h1,.t-display{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--fs-display);font-weight:var(--display-weight);line-height:1;letter-spacing:var(--display-track);text-wrap:balance}
h2,.t-h2{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--fs-h2);font-weight:var(--display-weight);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:calc(var(--display-track) + .006em);text-wrap:balance}
h3,.t-h3{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--fs-h3);font-weight:var(--display-weight);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:calc(var(--display-track) + .012em);text-wrap:balance}
.t-title{margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.lead{font-size:var(--fs-lead);line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.011em;color:var(--ink-3);max-width:620px;text-wrap:pretty}
.t-small{font-size:var(--fs-small);line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-3)}
.t-micro{font-size:var(--fs-micro);color:var(--ink-3)}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}
.eyebrow svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke-width:2}
.eyebrow .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
.t-muted{color:var(--ink-4)}
.t-accent{color:var(--accent-ink)}
.t-serif{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.t-mono{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.92em;letter-spacing:0}
.hl{position:relative;z-index:0;white-space:nowrap}
.hl::after{content:"";position:absolute;z-index:-1;left:.02em;right:.04em;bottom:.05em;height:.17em;border-radius:99px;background:var(--marker)}
.hl-soft{background:linear-gradient(transparent 58%,color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 20%,transparent) 58%)}

/* ---------- Buttons ---------- */
.btn{--h:48px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:var(--h);padding:0 24px;border:0;border-radius:var(--r-pill);font:600 15px/1 var(--font-body);letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:transform var(--dur-press) var(--ease-spring),box-shadow var(--dur-hover) var(--ease-out),background-color var(--dur-hover) var(--ease-out),filter var(--dur-hover) var(--ease-out)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.btn svg{width:17px;height:17px}
.btn-sm{--h:36px;padding:0 15px;font-size:13.5px}
.btn-lg{--h:54px;padding:0 28px;font-size:16px}
.btn-ink{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.btn-ink:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--ink) 85%,var(--bg))}
.btn-candy{color:var(--on-accent);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-hi),var(--accent) 60%,color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 88%,#000));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.5),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.14),0 0 0 1px color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent-ink) 40%,transparent),0 8px 20px -8px color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent-ink) 70%,transparent)}
.btn-candy:hover{filter:brightness(1.04) saturate(1.06)}
.btn-outline{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-2)}
.btn-outline:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}
.btn-ghost{background:var(--tint);color:var(--ink)}
.btn-halo{background:#fff;color:#0E1116;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,.14),0 18px 40px -12px rgba(10,20,120,.6)}
.btn .tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:22px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:var(--accent-ink);color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:650}
.btn-ink .tag{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:inherit}
.btn-candy .tag{background:rgba(0,0,0,.12);color:inherit}
.btn .sep{opacity:.45;font-weight:400}
.join{display:flex;gap:6px;width:min(100%,420px);margin:32px auto 0;padding:6px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--shadow-1)}
.join:focus-within{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--focus),var(--shadow-1)}
.join input{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:0 14px;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink)}
.join .btn{--h:42px}

/* ---------- Nav (floating glass pill) ---------- */
.nav{position:fixed;inset:12px 0 auto;z-index:50;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-inline:12px;pointer-events:none}
.nav__bar{pointer-events:auto;width:min(100%,980px);height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 8px 0 14px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--surface) 74%,transparent);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.6);backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.6);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line),0 10px 30px -14px rgba(var(--shadow-rgb)/.22)}
.nav__brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.nav__links{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-inline:auto}
.nav__links a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2);transition:background-color var(--dur-hover),color var(--dur-hover)}
.nav__links a:hover{background:var(--tint);color:var(--ink)}
.nav--on-color .nav__bar{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.22);color:#fff}
.nav--on-color .nav__links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
.nav--on-color .nav__links a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff}
.nav--on-color .btn-ink{background:#fff;color:#0E1116}
.app-icon{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:22.5%;flex:none;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 .5px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
@media (max-width:760px){.nav__links{display:none}.nav__bar{justify-content:space-between}}

/* ---------- Badge / chips / segmented / controls ---------- */
.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:32px;padding:0 12px 0 4px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--shadow-1);font-size:13px;font-weight:550;color:var(--ink-2)}
.badge__tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:24px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);font-size:12px;font-weight:650}
.badge--dot{padding-left:12px}.badge--dot::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:34px;padding:0 14px;border:0;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--ring);font:550 13.5px/1 var(--font-body);color:var(--ink-2)}
.chip--soft{background:var(--tint);box-shadow:none}
button.chip{cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--dur-hover),box-shadow var(--dur-hover),color var(--dur-hover)}
button.chip:hover{background:var(--surface-2);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-2)}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);box-shadow:none}
.segmented{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:var(--tint)}
.segmented button{height:34px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:var(--r-pill);background:transparent;font:550 14px/1 var(--font-body);color:var(--ink-3);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--dur-ui) var(--ease-out),color var(--dur-ui) var(--ease-out),box-shadow var(--dur-ui) var(--ease-out)}
.segmented [aria-selected="true"],.segmented [aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:var(--shadow-1)}
.switch{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;position:relative;flex:none;width:40px;height:24px;margin:0;border-radius:99px;background:var(--line-2);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--dur-ui) var(--ease-out)}
.switch::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.22);transition:transform var(--dur-ui) var(--ease-spring)}
.switch:checked{background:var(--accent)}.switch:checked::after{transform:translateX(16px)}
.range{--val:50%;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:24px;margin:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}
.range::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent) var(--val),var(--tint) var(--val))}
.range::-moz-range-track{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--tint)}
.range::-moz-range-progress{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--accent)}
.range::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:22px;height:22px;margin-top:-8px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 .5px rgba(0,0,0,.14),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.2);transition:transform var(--dur-press) var(--ease-spring)}
.range::-moz-range-thumb{width:22px;height:22px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 .5px rgba(0,0,0,.14),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.range:active::-webkit-slider-thumb{transform:scale(1.08)}
kbd{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;min-width:26px;height:26px;padding:0 7px;border-radius:var(--r-xs);font:500 12.5px/1 var(--font-mono);color:var(--key-ink);background:var(--key-bg);box-shadow:var(--key-edge)}
:where(p,li) kbd{height:21px;min-width:21px;margin-block:-3px;padding:0 5px;font-size:12px}
.avatar{flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-wash);color:var(--accent-ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:650}
@media (pointer:coarse){.btn-sm{--h:44px}.chip,.segmented button{min-height:44px}}

/* ---------- Layout ---------- */
.section{padding-block:var(--section-y)}
.section--alt{background:var(--bg-alt);box-shadow:var(--band-edge)}
.section-head{max-width:var(--text-max);margin:0 auto clamp(40px,5vw,64px);text-align:center}
.section-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:16px}
.section-head .lead{margin:18px auto 0}
.section-head--left{margin-inline:0;text-align:left}.section-head--left .lead{margin-inline:0}
.grid{display:grid;gap:16px}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:center}
.split--flip>:first-child{order:2}
.split .eyebrow{margin-bottom:14px}.split .lead,.split .t-small{margin-top:14px}.split .chips{margin-top:20px}
.stack>*+*{margin-top:clamp(72px,9vw,120px)}
.try{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,360px) 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:stretch}
@media (max-width:900px){.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.split,.try{grid-template-columns:1fr}.split--flip>:first-child{order:0}}
@media (max-width:640px){.grid-2,.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* ---------- Hero ---------- */
.hero{padding-top:calc(80px + clamp(48px,8vw,96px));text-align:center}
.hero .badge{margin-bottom:24px}
.hero h1{max-width:900px;margin-inline:auto}
.hero .lead{margin:22px auto 0}
.cta-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-top:32px}
.trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:4px 14px;margin-top:16px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}
.trust span+span::before{content:"·";margin-right:14px;color:var(--ink-4)}
@media (max-width:640px){.trust{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px}.trust span+span::before{display:none}}
.hero__visual{margin-top:clamp(44px,6vw,72px)}
.bleed{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-bottom:calc(-1*var(--bleed))}
.after-bleed{padding-top:calc(var(--section-y) + var(--bleed))}
.hero--split{text-align:left}.hero--split .container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
.hero--split h1,.hero--split .lead{margin-inline:0}.hero--split .cta-row,.hero--split .trust{justify-content:flex-start;align-items:flex-start}
@media (max-width:900px){.hero--split .container{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.hero--color{position:relative;overflow-x:clip;color:#fff;background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% -10%,#5C78FF 0%,#3655EC 45%,#2338C9 100%);padding-bottom:clamp(56px,7vw,88px)}
.hero--color::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0 1px,transparent 1px 96px),repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0 1px,transparent 1px 96px);-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 30%,#000,transparent);mask:radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 30%,#000,transparent)}
.hero--color>*{position:relative}
.hero--color .lead{color:rgba(255,255,255,.76)}.hero--color .t-muted{color:rgba(255,255,255,.62)}.hero--color .trust,.hero--color .trust span::before{color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}
.hero--color :focus-visible{outline-color:#fff}
.hero--color:has(.bleed){padding-bottom:0}
.hero--color .btn-outline{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.3)}
.hero--color .btn-outline:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.hero--wash{background:var(--wash)}

/* ---------- Surfaces ---------- */
.card{color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--ring);padding:24px}
.card--flat{background:var(--sunk);box-shadow:none}
.section--alt .card--flat{background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--ring)}
.card--raised{box-shadow:var(--shadow-2)}
